OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant boss makes plea to
OL,4,Ano-show diners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant boss who says his business
OL,7,Fis losing more than #1,000 each month
OL,8,Fdue to no-shows has pleaded with diners
OL,9,Fto call ahead if they are unable to
OL,10,Fmake their reservation.
OL,12,FJJ Wainwright, director of The Craddock
OL,13,Fin Knighton and two pubs in Leicester,
OL,14,Festimates up to 15 people each week are
OL,15,Fbooking tables but not showing up.
OL,17,FHe said the no-shows cost his business
OL,18,Fat least #20 in lost takings per
OL,19,Fbooking.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
