OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant boss makes plea to
OL,4,Ano-show diners
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whether it's spiteful or a genuine
OL,7,Fmistake, it's hard to know," he said.
OL,8,F"It could be someone we've barred
OL,9,Fbecause they've been inappropriate to
OL,10,Fstaff. It's frustrating."
